SUMMARY:PORCELAIN MASTERCLASS
DESCRIPTION:Make beautiful translucent porcelain vases with a colourful sur
 face design with contemporary ceramic artist Tania Vrancic. Explore your o
 wn creativity through mono-printing\, stenciling\, and painting with colou
 rful porcelain using slip-casting methods. Hand-build vases\, jewellery\, 
 and Christmas ornaments with your slabs. Enjoy this intuitive process to f
 ree your imagination. You will learn how to best prepare your work for fir
 ing and how to polish the surfaces after firing.
LOCATION:Cooroy Butter Factory Arts Centre
URL:https://events.humanitix.com/porcelain-masterclass
